-- No syntax registration or pre-tokenized body spans.
-- Both words are compiled by the March input-stream interpreter.
: define stream.word stream.begin ; immediate

-- A defining word reads its own name, evaluates normal March arithmetic now,
-- emits the resulting literal, and closes the new definition.
: answer: stream.word stream.begin 20 22 + stream.emit-literal stream.end ; immediate

define square dup * ;
answer: answer

-- Numeric recognition wins even over a dictionary entry named "42".
: 42 999 ;
7 square answer 42
